.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566830/extras/47b5dc9aaab31487d3726b3311092a6a.mp4?t=1700006527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect olives and grapes to unlock even more houses</strong></h2><br>There are 2 resources in Magna Graecia \u2014 olives and grapes. In exchange for them, you can get additional houses and continue expanding the village. Olive and grape fields produce these resources, while farms collect them. To obtain olives and grapes, you need to place farms and fields together. Each adjacency will give you 1 olive / grape. The higher the level of your farms and fields, the more resources you get!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566830/extras/e637d7bcb8fc6b9128addda3529be32e.poster.avif?t=1700006527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566830/extras/e637d7bcb8fc6b9128addda3529be32e.webm?t=1700006527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566830/extras/e637d7bcb8fc6b9128addda3529be32e.mp4?t=1700006527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Game mechanics are inspired by <i>Dorfromantik</i> and <i>Triple Town</i>.<br>Graphic design is inspired by <i>Islanders</i> and <i>Kingdoms and Castles</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566830/extras/7aab04377b474ac1a06590fbc8ead91e.poster.avif?t=1700006527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566830/extras/7aab04377b474ac1a06590fbc8ead91e.webm?t=1700006527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566830/extras/7aab04377b474ac1a06590fbc8ead91e.mp4?t=1700006527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>",
    "short_description": "A serene, colorful city-building puzzle game. Unleash your creativity and planning skills by placing tiles strategically, stacking, and leveling them up to create a breathtaking landscape. Transform your Greek village into a picturesque haven, dotted with olive farms and wineries!",
